6
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:33,700
consonants in it, but after rolling off of a few million tongues, it becomes round

7
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:39,440
and smooth. This smoothing process occurs when a tense vowel becomes reduced and

8
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:44,800
when an unvoiced consonant becomes voiced. The most common words are the smoothest,

9
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:49,980
the most reduced, the most often voiced. There are several very common words that

10
