14
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:18,200
Just as with most of the other consonants, there are two types, voiced and unvoiced.

15
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:23,760
The voiced TH is like a D, but instead of being in back of the teeth, it's a quarter

16
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:29,620
